# Pride of the Road: "Max speed — At the beginning of combat on your turn, target creature or Vehicle you control gains
# double strike until end of turn." (CR 702.178a, 702.4) Bot1 casts it on turn 1 (speed 1, CR 704.5aa) and Bolts Bot2 on
# each of turns 3, 5 and 7 for speed 2, 3 and 4 (CR 702.179d). At speed 3 on turn 5 nothing is put on the stack at the
# beginning of combat; at speed 4 on turn 7 the trigger gives the Memnite double strike, which then deals 1 first-strike
# and 1 regular combat damage to Bot2 (CR 702.4b): 20 - 3 x 3 - 2 = 9.

